      "group_id": "g0",
      "text": "877. 解下列方程：\na) $\\frac{x^2+1}{2}-x=2$；\nb) $x\\cdot\\frac{x+1}{6}-2x=2$；\nc) $3-\\frac{x+2}{4}\\cdot x=x+5$；\nd) $\\frac{3x+4}{5}-\\frac{x^2-4x-6}{10}=-1$；\ne) $\\frac{(y+1)^2}{12}-\\frac{7-y}{4}=\\frac{y}{2}$；\nf) $\\frac{3-y}{5}=\\frac{y-2}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^2}{8}$.",
      "lines": [
